// Tools (wf10 L7): a tool set is an operation type. `ergo gen llm`
// projects its hub (`ergo gen api`) as the tool specs a model gets, Parse
// from a model's Call to the hub's Request, and Result from the hub's
// Outcome to the Message that answers the call, as `ergo gen mcp` puts
// the same hub on MCP: one operation type is a program's Api, its MCP
// server and its model's tools. A program with no Api writes its
// ToolSpecs with jsonschema.Encode and matches the names itself.

// UnknownTool: a call names no tool of the set.
type UnknownTool { Name string }

// BadArguments: a call's arguments are not its tool's (not JSON, or not
// the tool's parameters), and why. A caller answers it to the model as a
// failed Result, so the model can write the call again.
type BadArguments { Name string, Reason string }
